<devicesets>
<deviceset name="WPME-FDSM_SIP-3" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:53197454/1" prefix="U">
<description>MagI³C-FDSM Fixed Step Down Regulator Module

Characteristics

Simplest design (no power supply knowledge required)
Leaded through-hole package for easy manufacturing and prototyping
Partly integrated CIN / COUT
L78x series linear regulator replacement (no heatsink required)
Low conducted and radiated EMI (compliant to EN55022 (CISPR-22) class B / EN55032 (CISPR-32) class B)

Applications

Point-of-load DC-DC applications of 9V, 12V, 15V, 18V, 24V, 36V and 48V industrial bus
Applications for logistics and automation
Linear regulator replacement
Interface and microcontroller supply
Test and measurement technology, medical technology
Supply of interfaces

Pin Positions

Type B - Pin position at the back as seen from the marking
Type F - Pin position at the front as seen from the marking

For details see datasheet PIN out section and dimensions!

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/MAGIC_FDSM_FIXED_OUTPUT_VOLTAGE

Updated by Ella Wu 2025-06-13</description>
